{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist awakens in complete darkness, with no memory of how they got there.<br>A faint light in the distance is their only clue. As they follow it, they find something that shouldn't exist in this place\u2014a toy from their childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> themed around memory and the mind.<br>As the player wanders through the pitch-black void, they encounter fragmented memories and eerie phenomena, slowly uncovering why they are here\u2014and what they must do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story branches based on your choices, leading to multiple possible endings.<br>Experience a chilling journey through silence, shadows, and self-reflection.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853350?t=1752546863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853350/9d42a62ef45a917b2d54310cee0c366570d55069/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752546863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853350/bba6c62a088a064aec9b89485c7fd4cb12e62706/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752546863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853350/bba6c62a088a064aec9b89485c7fd4cb12e62706/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752546863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist awakens in complete darkness, with no memory of how they got there.<br>A faint light in the distance is their only clue. As they follow it, they find something that shouldn't exist in this place\u2014a toy from their childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> themed around mem